-    *   Determine `dist_channel`: `depths` if `has_depth`, `hit_dists` if `has_hit_dist`, else None [S1, unofficial].
-    *   If `has_color` and `dist_channel` is not None, concatenate `dist_channel` to colors along the last axis to get $[C, N, D+1]$ and append zeros to backgrounds [S1, unofficial].
-    *   If `dist_channel` is not None and not `has_color`, set colors to `dist_channel[..., None]` [S1, unofficial].
